// pvp-sdk: Ancient Magicks (pvp_kit/scripts/ancients.rs2). Levels, runes, xp and max hits are OSRS's
// (https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Ancient_Magicks). Death runes are the fourth rune (extrarune),
// which no staff provides; staffs provide the air, fire and water as for the normal spellbook.
// Graphics are 377-wip's (ancients.spotanim). 377 names spotanims 362-367 the other way round from
// OSRS: Ice Burst is 363 (377's ice_blitz_impact), and Ice Blitz is 366 on the caster then 367 on
// the target (377's ice_burst_travel and ice_burst_impact), as RuneLite's GraphicID has them. Smoke
// impacts float at chest height, the rest sit on the ground. Sounds are 377's own impacts
// (content/synth/pvp_kit/ancients/), and a splash is the usual spellfail.

[magic_spell_smoke_rush]
